rarity 5

# health endpoint common to many services
Probe TCP HttpHealth q|GET /health HTTP/1.1\r\nHost: localhost\r\nUser-Agent: tokmap\r\nAccept: */*\r\nConnection: close\r\n\r\n|
rarity 5

# status endpoint common to many services
Probe TCP HttpStatus q|GET /status HTTP/1.1\r\nHost: localhost\r\nUser-Agent: tokmap\r\nAccept: */*\r\nConnection: close\r\n\r\n|
