# OCI distribution specification
Probe TCP HttpRegistry q|GET /v2/ HTTP/1.1\r\nHost: localhost\r\nUser-Agent: tokmap\r\nAccept: */*\r\nConnection: close\r\n\r\n|
rarity 6
ports 5000
